  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"Kupa Yedilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nHayal d\xFCnyan
    son zamanlarda \xE7ok geni\u015F. Kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    se\xE7enekleri kendi kafanda art\u0131r\u0131yor ve i\u015Fleri iyice i\xE7inden
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131lmaz bir hale sokuyorsun. Yapmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n her se\xE7im
    ise ya\u015Fam\u0131nda bir \"d\xFCzensizlik\" halini al\u0131yor. Sorumluluklar\u0131n
    birikiyor, atman gereken ad\u0131mlar y\u0131\u011F\u0131l\u0131yor. Di\u011Fer
    taraftan, alg\u0131lar\u0131n seni zaman zaman yan\u0131lt\u0131yor {{isim}}.
    Kar\u015F\u0131nda g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn ve hissetti\u011Fin \u015Feyler paralel
    olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in, kafa kar\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    ya\u015F\u0131yorsun. \u0130nsanlar\u0131n s\xF6zleri sana farkl\u0131 hissettirirken,
    davran\u0131\u015Flar\u0131 bamba\u015Fka hissettiriyor. Bocalaman\u0131n sona
    erece\u011Fi zamana kadar b\xFCy\xFCk tercihler ortaya koymamal\u0131s\u0131n.
    Beklemede kalmak, seni hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131ndan koruyacakt\u0131r.\n"
